<title>PORTUGAL: Teledanmark wants PT stake-paper.</title>
<headline>Teledanmark wants PT stake-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish telecommunications company TeleDanmark (TDK) wants to acquire a small stake in Portugal Telecom (PT), the director of the firm's Portuguese operations told the Diario Economico newspaper.</p>
<p>Mette Therkildsen told the paper the company wanted to buy more than 2.5 percent of PT.</p>
<p>PT's statutes prevent any shareholder who competes with the Portuguese telecoms operator from taking a stake of more than five percent without government approval.</p>
<p>Therkildsen said TDK had no intention of trying to buy a controlling stake but wanted to cement a possible future partnership with PT by taking a small stake.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau +(351-1) 3538254</p>
